{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "66719513975384faacf6a3a2727566e212c691a98c25aff2d604d7d2923cafe4", "ja": "（次のライブは、カウガールに扮した響も見所のひとつ\nだ。イメージ作りのために乗馬体験に来たが……）", "zh": "（下一场演唱会上，扮成牛仔女郎的响也是看点之一。为了塑造形象，来体验了骑马……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "1fe132ccb051335c3934e08238e9fa5f6eee4776b0e2d6250200326eac4a80d2", "ja": "ただいま！　{$P$}！\nどう？　自分、バッチリ乗りこなせてたでしょ♪", "zh": "我回来啦！{$P$}！\n我骑得很棒吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "05dfd64ae4149516423243d48f1fc98832a3e9b591c7d68100590169af039319", "ja": "ああ、響は乗馬も上手だな。今日初めて会った馬とは\n思えないくらい、息がピッタリだったよ！", "zh": "啊，响连骑马也很擅长啊。你们配合得默契十足，简直不像是今天才第一次见面的马！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "de510d75a60c9c4d2a923e6d9156b083fca49dc37a129f6105b8ec86e95adf68", "ja": "当然でしょ！　自分はなんでもカンペキに\nできちゃうからね！", "zh": "那是当然啦！毕竟我可是什么都能\n完美做到的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ea5a045261957d49c74a7073f2c439b352949e7f6061ea920995928f2d4e212a", "ja": "（ん？　これなら体験する必要もなかったような……）", "zh": "（嗯？这样一来，感觉好像也没必要体验了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "fd7f1cfd81353010235f789292d44800e590f9f4f93badffd8ad151bbc039b02", "ja": "結構プライドが高い子だったから、\n乗せてもらうのも、ちょっと大変だったけどね。", "zh": "因为她是个自尊心挺强的孩子，让她答应下来也费了点劲，不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "80061cf5d0ceca5b8e6ada97c999d1239983bfd1e1228f14d698aab2f301c1a1", "ja": "でも、いっぱい話しかけて、少しずつ距離を\n縮めていったら、ちゃんと心を開いてくれたんだ！", "zh": "不过，我多跟它说说话，一点一点拉近距离后，它终于对我敞开心扉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "685ca74468f0b3ecc8a1b3c91064c540d0f8ae6859ea0b16e465c825321526da", "ja": "この子のおかげで、カウガールのイメージも\nふくらんできたし、次のライブもバッチリさー！", "zh": "多亏了这孩子，我对牛仔女郎的形象也越来越有感觉了，下次演出也肯定没问题啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ed4af6158e492f5e84e3d5543f7ad91661c0f4f1125daaaee01a13aa7190c13a", "ja": "さすが響だな。馬は人を見るっていうから、\nきっと響のことを気に入ってくれたんだろうな。", "zh": "不愧是响啊。都说马是会看人的，它肯定是喜欢上响了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "ce5b6b45d31020c9a1f45a053b45ec10543b6a318189a44e777d916e79cd036e", "ja": "えへへ♪　走り終わった後、「まだまだ君を乗せて\n走りたい」って言ってくれたからね。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 跑完之后，它还对我说：“还想继续载着你奔跑”，所以啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ff5bbab2dc9e7cc98fcdf5b527c77764796622527f93354d9903e741173ec914", "ja": "そうか。\nけど、そう思ったのは馬だけじゃないみたいだぞ？", "zh": "这样啊。\n不过，看来有这种想法的不只是马哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "9e8736f8879a122d102604ae060b0b76610ad131334983c6dd2794ccfd90ba3e", "ja": "え、どういうこと？", "zh": "咦，这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3702c53dcd5ff6078633517db3483e8f97651a2ba0094d6f812102f8020d82ce", "ja": "響も「まだまだ、乗り足りない」って顔してるからな。\nその子と、もっと走っていたいんじゃないか？", "zh": "响也一副“还没骑够”的表情啊。你是不是还想和那孩子再跑一会儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "a5f4978c8aaf22fce57dfb184ef0e236ca7a5b0d5ed084fc0e0718792dbe2268", "ja": "あっ、バレてた？\nえへへ……実は、そうなんだよね。", "zh": "啊，被你看出来了？\n嘿嘿……其实，还真是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "1043e76420edd67e2064accd17bc20c7834bfc8d4820f6401baec3fda7f64bdc", "ja": "せっかく仲良くなれたのに、これでさよならは悲しい\nからね。……だからね、{$P$}？", "zh": "好不容易才变得要好，却要就这样道别，太让人难过了……所以呢，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1015_p", "source_sha256": "05528b0540a14be9714497abbe1bc03459bf3f2b2d18c800f431279c4530a3be", "ja": "もう一回、あの子に乗りたいんだろ？\nふたりが満足するまで、思う存分走っておいで。", "zh": "你还想再骑一次那孩子对吧？\n去尽情地驰骋吧，直到你们两个都满意为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "ff8d847debaec44ccbd809493502b8e27d83c29b6ffdf86d3b54a8a72238c1e4", "ja": "……やったー、ありがと！　このお礼は、\n自分たちがカッコよく走る姿でお返しするね！", "zh": "……太棒啦，谢谢你！这份心意，\n响会用我们帅气奔驰的模样来报答的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0423_1017_p", "source_sha256": "40f1c90087b3ccb0f4551d2a5415bfd657ac072d42fdcec303868528e9a73021", "ja": "（響の仲間が増えた、大事な体験になったな。\nこれなら次のライブも期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（这次成为响结识新伙伴的重要经历了。\n这样一来，下一场演唱会也很值得期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
